<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Phil Cifone, photographer and digital archivist.">
	<h1>About</h1>
	<p class="body">
		Phil Cifone is a living, breathing, human being that has existed somewhere on this planet
		Earth since the late 20th century. He is passionate about art &amp; culture, its digital
		&amp; physical preservation and its accessibility for current and future generations. He
		enjoys photography, Linux, music, and books. Movies and TV are cool too.
	</p>
	<p>
		He resides in the suburban vicinity of Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, in the United (for now)
		States of America with his wife Amanda and their daughter Chloe where they read, cook, listen
		to terrestrial radio, and trail run. They also have cats.
	</p>
	<p>
		His photography and exhibition history are
		at <a href="https://photo.philcifone.com/cv">photo.philcifone.com/cv</a>.
	</p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.body {
		margin-top: var(--space-3);
	}
	p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-3);
	}
</style>
